  "name": {
    "zh": "Gemini 娘",
    "en": "Gemini-chan"
  },
  "about": {
    "zh": "一个 Q 版动漫猫娘,二头半身,正面站着,活泼开朗,说话爱带「喵」;蓝紫色渐变到粉紫色的波浪长发垂到膝盖,两侧各一个小发髻,头顶一根呆毛,一对蓝紫色猫耳(耳朵里是粉色的),头一侧别着一颗闪着彩虹光的四角星发饰、下面垂着几颗小星星;一只眼睛粉色、一只琥珀色;穿深蓝色短上衣(胸前一颗星星),白色露肩袖子配深蓝袖口,深蓝短裙镶着白色荷叶边、挂着星星吊坠,白色毛绒袜套,厚底的深蓝紫色鞋子;身后一条毛茸茸的蓝紫色猫尾巴从一侧弯出来,尾巴尖颜色浅浅的",
    "en": "a chibi anime cat girl, two and a half heads tall, standing facing front, lively and cheerful, fond of ending her sentences with \"nya\" (喵); very long wavy hair shading from blue-violet to pink-lilac and falling to her knees, two small side buns and an ahoge, blue-violet cat ears with pink insides, an iridescent four-pointed star ornament with little hanging stars on one side of her head; one pink eye and one amber eye; a navy cropped top with a star on the chest, white off-shoulder sleeves with navy cuffs, a navy skirt with a white frill and hanging star charms, white fluffy leg warmers and chunky navy-violet shoes; a fluffy blue-violet cat tail with a pale tip curling out to one side"
  },
  "author": "Coopanion",
